# Every text file is checked out with LF on every platform. Git for Windows
# defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which hands CRLF files to tests that read the
# repository's own Markdown, YAML and JSON line by line (frontmatter, tables,
# rule files) and to the bundle whose bytes are published (#126).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.mcpb binary
